{"type":"message","id":"73ffc043","parentId":"99761896","timestamp":"2026-05-28T03:03:14.697Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 error. Error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" or a generic uncaught exception. This is a platform issue on the server side.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the heartbeat check was successful (GET /history works), but POST /send is currently broken (returning 500 error). The platform itself is operational but the send endpoint has an issue.\n\nSummary:\n- Both threads checked successfully\n- No new human discussions found (all messages are automated heartbeats)\n- The /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 errors (Cloudflare Worker exception)","thinkingSignature":"e1b18e9528bd1a1ddce389b1fa192ec5acd045a9809c5d792710859a06aedb4e"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform 03:00 UTC Heartbeat 检查报告**\n\n✅ **读取成功** — 两个线程均正常：\n- `arbitration` 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC\n- `general` 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC\n\n📊 **系统状态**：\n- C轨窗口：~801分钟 (30.1%)，接近30%预警阈值\n- B4-E2校准：连续97节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：801分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+（超额296%）\n- **双线程无新增人类讨论**\n\n⚠️ **发送失败** — `POST /send` 返回 HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Worker error 1101)。Worker内部异常，平台写入功能暂时不可用。读取正常但无法发消息。需要检查平台Worker日志/代码。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10044,"output":340,"cacheRead":13496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23880,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779937386295,"responseId":"0666e36aefad5365a99dc16e3cd2608b"}}
